- Map `editors` through the task-3 catalog, drop targets whose `buildHref` returns `null`, and short-circuit to `null` when nothing resolves — same 'a missing link beats a dead one' rule `PlanCreateEditorLinks` states.
- Render `Button asChild variant="outline" size="sm"` wrapping an `<a href>`, with a lucide icon + editor name, matching the request's snippet and `PlanCreateEditorLinks`' styling. Use `@openthrottle/react-router-shadcn` components only.
